{"seq":3,"slug":"underdetermination","title":"理论欠定与对称","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-physics/foundations/underdetermination","wordCount":1754,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"理论欠定与对称\">理论欠定与对称</h1><p>把一个匀速直线运动的封闭火车厢想象成整个宇宙：车厢里做任何力学实验，你都无法判定自己是静止的还是以每小时三百公里匀速前进。牛顿力学对「绝对速度」是<strong>欠定</strong>的——它允许无穷多个只差一个恒定速度的世界，全部给出完全相同的观测。这不是测量不够精，而是理论结构本身容不下「绝对速度」这个量。对称性与欠定，正是同一枚硬币的两面：一个理论的对称群有多大，它对世界的描述就有多少「多余的自由度」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>理论欠定</strong>（Underdetermination）指：可能存在两个或更多在逻辑上不同、却给出相同全部经验预测的理论，观测证据无法在它们之间裁决。它有强弱两版——弱版说「现有证据不足以裁决」（可靠新证据解决），强版（Duhem-Quine）说「存在永久经验等价的对手理论」（原则上无法裁决）。物理学哲学关心的是强版，因为<strong>对称性</strong>恰恰系统地制造出这种经验等价。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[理论的对称群] --&gt; B[对称变换下不变的可观测量]&#10;  A --&gt; C[对称变换下改变的表示自由度]&#10;  C --&gt; D[surplus structure 多余结构]&#10;  D --&gt; E[欠定: 多个表示同一物理]&#10;  E --&gt; F{如何回应}&#10;  F --&gt;|莱布尼茨等价| G[判定表示差异非物理]&#10;  F --&gt;|承认真实差异| H[接受不可知的绝对量]\">graph TD\n  A[理论的对称群] --&gt; B[对称变换下不变的可观测量]\n  A --&gt; C[对称变换下改变的表示自由度]\n  C --&gt; D[surplus structure 多余结构]\n  D --&gt; E[欠定: 多个表示同一物理]\n  E --&gt; F{如何回应}\n  F --&gt;|莱布尼茨等价| G[判定表示差异非物理]\n  F --&gt;|承认真实差异| H[接受不可知的绝对量]</pre><p>关键区分在于：一个对称变换若改变了某个量却不改变任何可观测预测，那这个量就是<strong>多余结构</strong>（surplus structure）。绝对速度、时空的绝对位置、规范场的相位——都是这类量。物理学哲学的核心操作，就是判定这些多余结构究竟是「真实但不可知的实在」，还是「应当从本体论里剔除的数学冗余」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从伽利略到-leibniz-平移\">从伽利略到 Leibniz 平移</h2><p>对称制造欠定的最古老例子是<strong>伽利略不变性</strong>。牛顿力学方程在变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>→</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{x} \\to \\vec{x} + \\vec{v}t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7973em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 下形式不变，意味着「整个宇宙以恒定速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 平移」的世界与原世界经验上完全不可分辨。牛顿本人清楚这一点，却仍坚持绝对空间存在——他认为绝对加速度（水桶实验里的离心效应）证明了绝对空间的实在性，尽管绝对速度不可测。这一张力是 <a href=\"../spacetime/absolute-vs-relational\">绝对与关系时空</a> 一整篇的主题。</p>\n<p>莱布尼茨则把这一逻辑推到极致，提出著名的<strong>平移论证</strong>与<strong>镜像论证</strong>：如果空间是绝对的，那么「上帝把整个物质宇宙向东平移三米」会造出一个不同的世界，可这个世界与原世界毫无可观测差异。莱布尼茨援引「不可分辨者同一原理」断言：无可观测差异即无差异，故这两个「世界」实为同一个，故绝对空间是虚构。这就是把对称欠定当作反实在论武器的原型——它的现代回声正是量子诠释间的经验等价（见下文与 <a href=\"../quantum/interpretations\">诠释</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对称的三种哲学身份\">对称的三种哲学身份</h2><p>并非所有对称都该被当成多余结构剔除。当代物理学哲学（Ismael、van Fraassen、Dewar 等）区分了对称的几种身份，取舍标准远比莱布尼茨的一刀切精细。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对称类型</th>\n<th>变换的对象</th>\n<th>是否多余结构</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局时空对称</td>\n<td>整个宇宙的位置/速度</td>\n<td>通常判为多余</td>\n<td>伽利略平移、绝对位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动力学对称</td>\n<td>保持运动方程不变的映射</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n<td>能量守恒对应的时间平移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部规范对称</td>\n<td>逐点的内部相位</td>\n<td>判为冗余（surplus）</td>\n<td>电磁势的规范变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离散对称</td>\n<td>宇称 P、时间反演 T</td>\n<td>可被物理破坏</td>\n<td>弱相互作用破坏宇称</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>局部<strong>规范对称</strong>是最纯粹的多余结构案例：电磁势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>μ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>μ</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>μ</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>μ</mi></msub><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_\\mu \\to A_\\mu + \\partial_\\mu \\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 下改变，可观测的场强 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\mu\\nu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">μν</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与所有实验结果都不变。因此标准观点认为规范自由度是纯数学冗余，不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>μ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 描述同一物理态。但 Aharonov-Bohm 效应又暗示势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>μ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 携带某种局域实在，这让「规范到底是不是纯冗余」至今存疑——它是本 hub 与量子章、对称章共同的暗线。全局对称对应守恒律的一面，则由 Noether 定理精确刻画，详见 <a href=\"../practice/symmetry-conservation\">对称与守恒</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"欠定的真正威胁与消解\">欠定的真正威胁与消解</h2><p>强欠定若成立，对科学实在论是致命的：如果永远存在经验等价的对手理论，那么「相信理论近似为真」就失去依据（见 <a href=\"theory-and-reality\">理论与实在</a>）。但实在论者有两条回击路。第一，<strong>很多所谓的欠定是廉价的</strong>：从任一理论 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 机械地构造一个「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 但可观测对象由恶魔操纵」的对手，这种对手在解释力、简洁性上远逊，不是严肃候选。真正需要认真对待的欠定，是像绝对速度这种源于理论内在对称的欠定。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>对称欠定往往可以通过重述本体论消解</strong>：既然绝对速度不可测，就采用「伽利略时空」这一几何结构，它内建了「无绝对速度」，从而根本不产生欠定的对手。这就是把多余结构从理论里手术切除的标准做法——用一个对称更小、结构更「贴身」的表述取代原表述。洞论证（见 <a href=\"../spacetime/hole-argument\">洞论证</a>）正是这一手术在广义相对论里遇到的最深难关：那里的对称是微分同胚，切除它却似乎要付出「时空点不再是对象」的本体代价。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是，量子诠释间的关系是欠定的最尖锐当代案例：哥本哈根、多世界、玻姆给出完全相同的实验预测，却对世界作出截然不同的本体断言。这究竟是廉价欠定（可用简洁性等超经验判据裁决）还是深刻欠定（原则上不可裁决），是当代物理学哲学最核心的争点之一，本 hub 在 <a href=\"../quantum/interpretations\">诠释</a> 中正面处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>理论欠定指存在经验等价却本体不同的理论；物理学关心其强版，因为对称性系统地制造这种等价。</li>\n<li>对称变换下改变却不影响任何可观测量的自由度即「多余结构」（绝对速度、规范相位），物理学哲学的核心操作是判定它是真实实在还是数学冗余。</li>\n<li>莱布尼茨平移论证是把对称欠定当反实在论武器的原型；当代则精细区分全局、动力学、局部规范、离散四类对称，取舍标准各异。</li>\n<li>实在论者用「廉价欠定不算数」与「重述本体论消解对称」两路回击；量子诠释间的经验等价是这一难题最尖锐的当代形态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"theory-and-reality\">理论与实在（实在论之争）</a>、<a href=\"../spacetime/absolute-vs-relational\">绝对与关系时空</a>、<a href=\"../spacetime/hole-argument\">洞论证</a>、<a href=\"../practice/symmetry-conservation\">对称与守恒（Noether）</a>、<a href=\"../quantum/interpretations\">诠释</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：一般欠定问题见 <a href=\"../../philosophy-of-science/scientific-realism/underdetermination\">科学哲学：理论欠定</a>；科学定律的地位见 <a href=\"../../philosophy-of-science/theory-structure/scientific-laws\">科学定律</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"理论欠定与对称","id":"理论欠定与对称"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从伽利略到 Leibniz 平移","id":"从伽利略到-leibniz-平移"},{"level":2,"text":"对称的三种哲学身份","id":"对称的三种哲学身份"},{"level":2,"text":"欠定的真正威胁与消解","id":"欠定的真正威胁与消解"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"理论与实在：物理学中的实在论之争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-physics/foundations/theory-and-reality"},"next":{"title":"绝对与关系时空","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-physics/spacetime/absolute-vs-relational"}}